hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1696","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne rehem par farishta muqarrar farmaya hai. Wo kehta hai: Ae mere Rab! Nutfa. Ae mere Rab! Jama hua khoon. Ae mere Rab! Gosht ka tukda. Phir jab Wo us ki khalq ka faisla karna chahta hai to kehta hai: Mard ya aurat? Bad-bakht ya khush-bakht? Phir rizq aur muddat kya hai? Phir us ki maan ke pet mein likha jata hai."
"1697","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum janaze mein they, Baqi al-Gharqad mein. Phir hamare paas Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye. Phir baithe aur hum Aap ke ird-gird baithe, jabke Aap ke paas chhadi thi. Phir Aap ne sar jhukaya. Phir apni chhadi se kuredne lage. Phir farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahi, koi jaan jaan-dar nahi magar us ki jagah Jannat aur Dozakh mein likhi gayi hai. Aur magar wo bad-bakht ya khush-bakht likhi gayi hai. Phir ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Phir kya hum apni kitab par bharosa na karein aur amal chhor dein? Phir hum mein se jo khush-bakht hoga wo khush-bakhton ke amal ki taraf hoga. Aur jo hum mein bad-bakhton mein se hoga wo bad-bakhton ke amal ki taraf hoga? Aap ne farmaya: Raha khush-bakht, wo khush-bakhti ke amal ke liye aasan kiye jayenge. Aur raha bad-bakht, wo bad-bakhti ke amal ke liye aasan kiye jayenge. Phir Aap ne parha [raha jis ne diya aur parhez kiya] ayat tak."
"1698","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Jannat wale Dozakh walon se pehchane jate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Us ne kaha: Phir amal karne wale kyun amal karte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Har ek us ke liye amal karta hai jis ke liye paida kiya gaya, ya jis ke liye aasan kiya gaya."
"1699","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mard Jannat walon ke amal karta hai, logon ko zahir mein, jabke wo Dozakh walon mein se hota hai. Aur beshak mard Dozakh walon ke amal karta hai, logon ko zahir mein, jabke wo Jannat walon mein se hota hai."
"1700","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Adam aur Musa ne hujjat ki. Phir Musa ne un se kaha: Ae Adam! Tum hamare baap ho. Tum ne hamein mayoos kiya. Aur hamein Jannat se nikala. Phir Adam ne un se kaha: Ae Musa! Allah ne tumhe apne kalam se muntakhab farmaya. Aur tumhare liye apne hath se likha. Kya tum mujhe us mamle par malamat karte ho jo Allah ne mujh par muqaddar farmaya, mujhe paida karne se chalees saal pehle? Phir Adam Musa par ghalib aaye, teen martaba."
"1701","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Beshak Allah ne Ibn Adam par zina mein se us ka hissa likha hai jo wo payega, la-mahala. Phir aankh ka zina dekhna hai. Zaban ka zina bolna hai. Dil tamanna karta hai aur khwahish karta hai. Sharmgah us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb karti hai."
"1702","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har bachcha fitrat par paida hota hai. Phir us ke walidain use Yahoodi banate hain ya Nasrani banate hain ya Majusi banate hain. Jaise janwar poora janwar janta hai. Kya tum us mein kate hue mein se kuchh mehsus karte ho? Phir Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) kehte: [Allah ki fitrat jis par Us ne logon ko paida kiya. Allah ki khalq mein tabdeeli nahi. Ye seedha deen hai]."
"1703","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mushrikon ki aulad ke bare mein poochha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah zyada janta hai jo wo karne wale they."
"1704","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mushrikon ke bachchon ke bare mein poochha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah, jab unhe paida kiya, zyada janta hai jo wo karne wale they."
"1705","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye ayat tilawat farmayi [Wo hai jis ne tum par kitab nazil farmayi. Us mein se mohkam ayatein hain jo kitab ki maan hain, doosri mutashabeh. Phir jin ke dilon mein tedhapan hai wo us mein se mutashabeh ki pairwi karte hain, fitna chahte hue aur us ki taweel chahte hue] Aap ke qaul [aqal wale] tak. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir jab tum unhe dekho jo us mein se mutashabeh ki pairwi karte hain to wahi hain jinhe Allah ne naam diya. Phir un se bacho."
